# CQRS Slice

- Each feature folder contains command/query, handler, validator, and DTO together
- Do not create Mapping/, Dtos/, or Validators/ folders
- Feature mapper lives at feature root, for example ProductMapper.cs
- Endpoints must return TypedResults, never IResult
- Every endpoint declares Produces<T> and ProducesProblem where applicable
